# navigate-to-model.plan — first real NAVIGATE step test, end-to-end,
# built to close the "resolver correctness != semantic correctness"
# gap from HARNESS-DELEGATION-PIPELINE.md §6: this doesn't just check
# the model named A real label, it checks the post-action receipt's
# real focus (nav=) actually equals the index we dispatched to.
NAVIGATE | switch to a different AI model | [ "$(grep -oP '(?<= )nav=\K\S+' "$STEP1_OUT")" = "$STEP1_TARGET" ]
